<title>POLAND: ALL FARM FOOD RIGHTS SUBSCRIBED.</title>
<headline>ALL FARM FOOD RIGHTS SUBSCRIBED.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investors took all 600,000 shares in Polish meat processing firm Farm Food SA's rights issue offered in January and February at 33 zlotys per share, the company said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
